### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:59817
@userId = 1

### Create a new marker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "Deer Sighting",
  "category": 2,
  "latitude": 45.5231,
  "longitude": -93.2467,
  "description": "Large buck spotted near the oak tree"
}

### Create another marker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "Weather Station",
  "category": 4,
  "latitude": 45.5189,
  "longitude": -93.2501,
  "description": "Temperature and humidity monitoring station"
}

### Get all markers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Get markers by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers?category=2
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Get specific marker (replace with actual ID from create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers/marker_123456789
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Update marker (replace with actual ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers/marker_123456789
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "name": "Updated Deer Sighting",
  "description": "Large 8-point buck spotted near the oak tree at dawn"
}

### Delete marker (replace with actual ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/markers/marker_123456789
X-User-Id: {{userId}}